; Run-Gears - es2gears on ogles2.library, until Esc in its window or Ctrl-C.
;   CD to this directory, then:   Execute Run-Gears
; Nothing is installed: libs/ is added to LIBS: while it runs.
FailAt 21
If NOT EXISTS libs/ogles2.library
  Echo "Please CD into the ogles2-gears directory first."
  Quit 20
EndIf
Assign GEARS: ""
Assign LIBS: GEARS:libs ADD
; An older ogles2.library still in memory would be used instead of this one.
Avail FLUSH >NIL:
SetEnv CORPUS_FRAMES 0
Echo "es2gears: three gears turning. Esc in its window (or Ctrl-C) ends it."
GEARS:bin/es2gears
UnSetEnv CORPUS_FRAMES
Assign LIBS: GEARS:libs REMOVE
Assign GEARS:
